<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mahi777 - Ultimate Betting Experience</title>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #0d0d0d;
            color: #fff;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        header .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }
        header nav a {
            margin: 0 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        header nav a:hover {
            color: #ffcc00;
        }
        .hero {
            background: url('https://rare-gallery.com/uploads/posts/565456-casino.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
        }
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .hero button {
            padding: 10px 30px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background-color: #ffcc00;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .hero button:hover {
            background-color: #e6b800;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
        }
        .feature-box {
            width: 30%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-box img {
            width: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-box h3 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }
        .feature-box p {
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .contact {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518917020000-9be375ac6f84') no-repeat center center/cover;
            background-size: cover;
            padding: 50px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .contact form {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .contact input, .contact textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            border: 1px solid #fff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .contact button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #ffcc00;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .contact button:hover {
            background-color: #e6b800;
        }
        /* Social Media Icons */
        .social-icons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .social-icons a {
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #fff;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.3s;
        }
        .social-icons a:hover {
            color: #ffcc00;
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }
        .social-icons a.instagram:hover {
            color: #e4405f;
        }
        .social-icons a.whatsapp:hover {
            color: #25d366;
        }
        .social-icons a.facebook:hover {
            color: #1877f2;
        }

        .about {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e1e 0%, #4f4f4f 100%);
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .about h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #ffcc00;
        }
        .about p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .about button {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            background-color: #ffcc00;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .about button:hover {
            background-color: #e6b800;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
            .features {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .feature-box {
                width: 80%;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }
            .about h2 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            .about p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">Mahi777</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About Us</a>
            <a href="#games">Games</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Welcome to Mahi777</h1>
            <p>Experience the thrill of online betting with exclusive bonuses and live games!</p>
            <button>Join Now</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" id="about">
        <div class="feature-box">
            <img src="https://cdn.icon-icons.com/icons2/1527/PNG/512/shield_106660.png" alt="Secure Platform">
            <h3>Secure Platform</h3>
            <p>Your safety is our priority. Bet with confidence on our fully encrypted platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
            <img src="https://cms.kingcasino.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/big-bonus-logo-slots.png" alt="Exciting Bonuses">
            <h3>Exciting Bonuses</h3>
            <p>Enjoy generous bonuses and promotions that give you more chances to win!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
            <img src="https://www.pngmart.com/files/21/24-7-Service-PNG-Isolated-Pic.png" alt="24/7 Support">
            <h3>24/7 Support</h3>
            <p>Our dedicated support team is available around the clock to assist you.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about">
        <h2>About Mahi777</h2>
        <p>At Mahi777, we are dedicated to providing an unparalleled online betting experience. Whether you're a seasoned bettor or new to the world of online gaming, our platform offers everything you need. We ensure top-notch security, exciting bonuses, and round-the-clock customer support. Our team is constantly working to innovate and improve your gaming experience, making Mahi777 the ultimate destination for betting enthusiasts.</p>
        <button>Learn More</button>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <form>
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
            <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="Your Phone Number" required>
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Your Message" rows="5" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
        <div class="social-icons">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" class="instagram">
                <i class="fab fa-instagram"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/" target="_blank" class="whatsapp">
                <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" class="facebook">
                <i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
